    "body": "Problem: Ui2 only applies the last highlight in 'rulerformat', ignoring\r\n         the stacked highlights\r\n\r\nSolution: Add nvim__get_attr() api to retrieve the combined highlight\r\n          attr and use it to create and cache a highlight group for each\r\n          combination\r\n\r\n<!--\r\n  Thank you for contributing to Neovim!\r\n  If this is your first time, check out https://github.com/neovim/neovim/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#pull-requests-prs\r\n  for our PR guidelines.\r\n-->\r\n\r\nfixes: #42014 \r\n\r\nSomething I'd like to point out - `Ui2Attr<N>`  groups are created once per attr_id and cached in attr_hls so even if `:hi clear` removes them, attr_hls still holds their values. \r\nA colorscheme that re-applies identical User groups gets the same `attr_id`, so the ruler may lose its stacked highlight until ui2 is restarted which is a rare case thus left untested\r\nA Colorscheme autocmd that resets the cache would fix it ",
    "closed_at": "2026-10-15T22:38:45Z",
